cense mrna  vaccines from the west like pfizer and  moderna so they're going to be  increasingly locked down and they're  going to have a really hard time  responding to an extraordinarily  transmissible omicron variant this is  the second largest economy in the world  it's a big driver of global growth and  if you've got those lockdowns persisting  this year you're still going to see the  supply chain challenges you're still  going to see the inflation as a  consequence china's covet policy is  actually our top risk for 2022.  all right ian bremer bringing in the top  three things we should be concerned  about for global instability ian thank  you very much we'll keep an eye on them

